        "summary": "Pentanuclear Dy5 cluster showing SMM-type slow magnetic relaxation with strong QTM. χMT at 300 K is 69.63 cm3 K mol−1 (theory 70.85 for five uncoupled DyIII). Ueff/kB = 1.48 K (0 Oe) and 4.76 K (2000 Oe). Magnetization at 1.8 K and 70 kOe is 27.78 NμB, unsaturated; M vs H/T curves do not superimpose. Hysteresis at 2 K is not pronounced.",
